<title>USA: Kohl's Corp Q1 May 3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Kohl's Corp Q1 May 3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MENOMONEE FALLS, Wis. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						     Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						May 3, 1997   May 4, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $600,547	 $468,638</p>
<p> Cost of Merchandise Sold		397,377	  311,836</p>
<p> Gross Margin				203,170	  156,802</p>
<p>Selling, General and</p>
<p>  Administrative Expenses		146,751	  115,890</p>
<p> Depreciation and Amortization	  13,000	    9,965</p>
<p> Pre-opening Expense			12,112	    3,639</p>
<p> Operating Income			   31,307	   27,308</p>
<p> Interest Expense, Net		     5,836	    4,102</p>
<p> Income before Income Taxes	     25,471	   23,206</p>
<p> Income Taxes				 10,163	    9,445</p>
<p> Net Income				   15,308	   13,761</p>
<p> Earnings per Share			   0.21	     0.19</p>
<p> Weighted Average Shares		  73,992	   73,771</p>
<p>NOTE: Cost of merchandise includes LIFO inventory charge of $1.5 million in 1997 period and $1.2 million in 1996.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
